DESCRIPTION:This week at Run Club we have Brooks joining us for a SHOE DEM
 O! Get excited to try their new Ghost Max 4 and Hyperion Max 4 running sho
 es! The route is ~3 miles from Sports Basement through the Kawana Springs 
