  welcome — whether you're a sprinter\, a casual jogger\, or just getting
  started\, there's a spot for you. As usual\, stick around after to enjoy 
 some refreshments and pizza and mingle with your fellow runners. Fun times
  guaranteed! Hope to see you there!
